            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Realtime Companion 0.1.133</h2><ul><li>Canonicalizes Hermes runtime identities across current and legacy persisted session schemas.</li><li>Uses the exact persisted session key, runtime, agent, and route when dispatching durable work.</li><li>Preserves distinct Hermes sessions while eliminating ambiguous inherited agent and route aliases.</li><li>Adds migration coverage for older VoiceClaw Companion session records without changing OpenClaw, Hermes, or Codex installations.</li></ul>
]]></description>
